// Sheet: "persistent fire control zone (creatures ending turn near the
// rolling sphere take Dexterity-save fire damage; mobile each round)".
// Primary effect is periodic fire damage from a zone, not a one-shot burst --
// same reasoning as cloud_of_daggers.ron: `StaticAura` + a damage `BuffKind`
// (here `Burning`, a perfect flavor match for "living flame" and already a
// real per-tick HP-drain buff, `common/src/comp/buff.rs`, tick_dur 0.25s).
// `BasicAura`'s own `flame_cloak.ron`/`gnarling/totem/red.ron` already
// deliver `Burning` through an aura at flat (non-fraction) strength values
// in the 1.2-3.0 range -- this reuses that same strength unit directly, just
// through `StaticAura` instead of `BasicAura` since this sphere is not the
// caster (see spirit_guardians.ron for the one spell in this batch that
// genuinely IS caster-attached and uses `BasicAura` instead). The sheet's
// "mobile each round, caster wills it across the battlefield" rider is
// dropped -- no movement primitive exists for a `StaticAura` zone (it is
// pinned to the caster's cast position for its whole `aura_duration`,
// common/src/states/static_aura.rs), the same class of drop already accepted
// for entangle/fog_cloud/grease's own aimed-range limitation.
StaticAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.6,
    cast_duration: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    energy_cost: 55.0,
    targets: OutOfGroup,
    auras: [
        (kind: Burning, strength: 3.0, duration: Some(2), category: Some(Magical)),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(20.0),
    range: 3.0,
    sprite_info: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Primordial)),
)
